@* R-47: the number of files of a disk is a limit most operators do not know (the technical word is
   not shown). A question mark with an OE tooltip, readable by keyboard and by screen readers, says in one
   sentence why a disk with free space can still refuse to write. *@
<OmniTooltip Text="@Help" Focusable="true" MaxWidth="OmniTooltipWidth.Wide">
    <span role="img" aria-label="@Help" data-testid="file-count-help"><OmniIcon Name="OmniIconName.Question" Class="omni-u-text-muted" aria-hidden="true" /></span>
</OmniTooltip>
